# CLAUDE.md — subfrost-app

> Drop this file at the root of `subfrost-app` to pull in the subfrost-ops domain pack.

**Layer**: UX. This repo consumes stable APIs from foundational repos (**alkanes-rs** ts-sdk, **subzero-rs** signing). Changes here are locally bounded — they cannot break foundational repos. No upstream verification required; verify your own consumers (tests, sibling hooks). Use `pattern-conformance` skill for the canonical patterns to mirror. See `docs/LAYER-MODEL.md`.

Next.js 13+ App Router frontend for the Alkanes metaprotocol. Wallet adapters: UniSat, OYL, Xverse, OKX, keystore. AMM, vaults (FIRE), cross-chain bridges, frBTC wrapping.

## Pre-work skills to load
- `alkanes-onboarding` — mental model + pre-work rules
- `browser-wallet-safety` — the 2026-03-01 symbolic-address bug + PSBT/UTXO rules
- `height-poller-frontend` — single-source query invalidation
- `ts-sdk-alkanes-execute` — `inputRequirements` format + two-protostone composition
- `protostone-cellpack-edicts` — when something doesn't dispatch

## Reviewers to invoke
- `subfrost-frontend-reviewer` for any hook / wallet adapter change
- `bitcoin-security-reviewer` for any PSBT / signing path change
- `typescript-reviewer` (built-in) for general TS hygiene

## Rules pack
- `rules/alkanes/*` (security funds-at-risk list is the most important)
- `rules/typescript/*` (built-in)
- `rules/web/*` (built-in)
- `rules/common/*` (built-in)

